 "description": "WCE13: a question's 18.6.6 expression condition as the compiler reads it (research_design.py read_condition, _condition) and as Dotazník shows it (research/questionnaire.ts conditionOf). Q2 carries the condition. set and refused are the compiler's own verdicts; unread is where the web does not decide and shows the condition as written; server is then what the compiler makes of it (no_compile: the design does not compile).",
